<https://star.sub.uni-goettingen.de/voc/contributionrole/Recipient> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ,
<https://star.sub.uni-goettingen.de/model/ContributionRole> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://star.sub.uni-goettingen.de/voc/contributionrole/ContributionRoleConceptScheme>;
