  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A person towards whom a work (e.g. a letter) was addressed."@en;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Only addressed or also sent?; Bibframe and MARC21 have Addressee/Recipient as a Contribution Role: https://wiki.deutsche-digitale-bibliothek.de/display/DFD/Feld+700 http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/rcp.html";
